{
 "id": "74_240",
 "kind": "buffer",
 "model": "tristate",
 "function": "Buffer",
 "description": "Octal buffer/line driver, inverting, 3-state outputs (two 4-bit groups, each with an active-low output enable)",
 "drawer": [
  "Logic"
 ],
 "note": "Standard '240 20-pin pinout, same numbering in every package (N, DW, DB, NS, PW, DGS, DGV, J, W, FK LCCC, RKS/RGY VQFN with exposed pad not a pin, CY QSOP/SOIC): sn74hc240 p.3 (incl. FK), sn74act240 p.3 (incl. RKS), sn74ls240 p.3 (incl. FK), sn74auc240 p.1 (RGY), sn74lvc240a p.3, sn74ahc240 p.3, sn74lv240a p.4, sn74abt240a p.1, cy74fct240t p.1 (incl. L/LCC). Name variants folded to the TI names: LS/S sheets print 1G/2G for 1OE/2OE (sn74ls240 p.3); CD74AC/ACT and CD74HC/HCT number bits from 0 (1A0-1A3, 2Y0-2Y3: cd74ac240 p.4 Pin Functions, cd74hc240 p.3 pinout drawing); CY FCT prints OEA/OEB, DA0-3/DB0-3, OA0-3/OB0-3 (cy74fct240t p.1, OEA=1OE, DAn=1A(n+1), OAn=1Y(n+1)). Function: OE low -> Y = not A, OE high -> Z (sn74hc240 p.9, cy74fct240t p.2).",
